### GET all the exercises
GET http://localhost:8080/api/exercises
Accept: application/json

### POST new exercise
POST http://localhost:8080/api/exercises
Accept: application/json

{
    "id": null,
    "title": "new exercise"
}

### PUT exercise
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/exercises/2
Accept: application/json

{
    "id": null,
    "title": "no more new"
}

### DELETE exercise
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/exercises/3
Accept: application/json




### GET segments by exercise_id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/exercises/1/segments
Accept: application/json

### POST a new segment to exercise_id
POST http://localhost:8080/api/exercises/1/segments
Accept: application/json

{
 "id": null,
 "title": "new segment"
}

### PUT segment
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/exercises/1/segments/1
Accept: application/json

{
    "id": null,
    "title": "no more new"
}

### DELETE segment
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/exercises/1/segments/8
Accept: application/json
